{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n台慶劇《璀璨之城》今晚（27日）迎來高潮，江美儀為保吳卓羲平安不惜向張智霖當眾下跪認罪。三人敗走郊外舊居後張曦雯竟因居住環境惡劣而大發雷霆。這場豪門恩怨背後隱藏着足以令整個官家徹底崩潰駭人算計。\n</p>\n<h2>江美儀遭張智霖踩入精神病院挑釁</h2>\n<p>官孝賢為奪取尚利鋒主席之位並獨吞遺產而設計陷害官孝君，更手握官詩雅偷食短片以脅迫其抹黑官孝君誠信。他為了逼出股份轉讓書特意前往精神病院接丁麗明回家，並一臉得戚透露已把官孝君逼上絕路。官孝賢陰森嘲諷丁麗明精神狀況，徹底激怒對方失控拽住其衫領，兩大演技派正面交鋒讓緊張氣氛瞬間推向頂點。</p>\n<h2>江美儀霸氣重返官家 為保子女當眾下跪認罪</h2>\n<p>丁麗明隨後剪了一頭俐落短髮並身穿白色西裝霸氣重返官家，得知官孝賢意圖後竟做出驚人舉動，當眾下跪認錯直指自己毒死母親，並願意交出股份以換取子女平安。官孝賢全程默不作聲僅以眼神暗中思索真偽，直到官孝君聽從母親建議答應放棄爭奪並收手離開，他才冷笑一聲扶起丁麗明。這場表面看似屈服實為測試與反擊官孝賢計策展現出極深城府。</p>\n<h2>江美儀護仔怒斥張曦雯冇用 暫住舊居原來另有玄機</h2>\n<p>丁麗明與官孝君、張曦雯三人敗走香港後，投靠官孝君爺爺的昔日秘書，暫住其位於郊外的舊居。大屋環境簡陋，令張曦雯大為不滿，當場向官孝君發難，質問是否奶奶要求三人同住。丁麗明眼見兒子遭喝斥，隨即起身反擊，怒斥張曦雯多年來未能幫上丈夫半點忙，更一邊破口大罵，一邊將她推向門口，直斥她阻手阻腳，婆媳衝突瞬間爆發。不過，預告揭露三人選擇在此落腳原來另有玄機：爺爺昔日斥資10億元購入的股票，如今價值已升至原來的400倍，總值高達4000億元！</p>\n<h2>江美儀變臉演技獲網民激讚</h2>\n<p>兩大演技派這場精彩絕倫試探與反擊播出後迅速引起網絡熱烈討論。大批網民紛紛留言大讚江美儀與張智霖大鬥演技擦出火花，直指這幕對峙場面張力十足。有粉絲激動表示「想睇佢點同Chilam鬥」，亦有觀眾留言稱讚江美儀情緒秒切換非常震撼，瘋癲大笑秒變霸氣眼神展現出高超演技水平。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153256941728_7436737636ae0b5edb5396.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀與張智霖正面交鋒（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153256941728_7436737636ae0b5edb5396.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀與張智霖正面交鋒（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153657759236_654988906ae0b5f0f1dad.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀遭張智霖踩入精神病院挑釁，激動得一手扯住對方衫領。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311153657759236_654988906ae0b5f0f1dad.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀遭張智霖踩入精神病院挑釁，激動得一手扯住對方衫領。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931115395838082_20223592446ae0b5f3f26e8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀剪短髮兼換上白色西裝，霸氣重返官家。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/17931115395838082_20223592446ae0b5f3f26e8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀剪短髮兼換上白色西裝，霸氣重返官家。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154191291713_11422531796ae0b5f652e69.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀放下尊嚴跪地認罪，更提出交出股份換取子女平安。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154191291713_11422531796ae0b5f652e69.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀放下尊嚴跪地認罪，更提出交出股份換取子女平安。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154393969944_2864433466ae0b5f83215a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154393969944_2864433466ae0b5f83215a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154637648812_648656306ae0b5fae61ce.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311154637648812_648656306ae0b5fae61ce.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155582536716_11733331766ae0b60458b32.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀怒斥張曦雯多年來幫唔到丈夫（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155582536716_11733331766ae0b60458b32.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀怒斥張曦雯多年來幫唔到丈夫（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155964218886_4139050526ae0b6080dadc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀一邊鬧一邊推向門口。（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179311155964218886_4139050526ae0b6080dadc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀一邊鬧一邊推向門口。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508782_y_16631089566ae0bb1b9d3d3-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 江美儀看似敗走實則留有後路，預告揭露爺爺竟有一筆驚人秘密資金（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508782_y_16631089566ae0bb1b9d3d3-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>江美儀看似敗走實則留有後路，預告揭露爺爺竟有一筆驚人秘密資金（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508779_y_712368686ae0ba31a7194-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 爺爺原來暗藏巨額資產，昔日斥資10億買入的股票，揸到今日竟已升值400倍！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508779_y_712368686ae0ba31a7194-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>爺爺原來暗藏巨額資產，昔日斥資10億買入的股票，揸到今日竟已升值400倍！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508781_y_12634100296ae0bb1dd4dd6-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 爺爺當年用10億買入股票，持有至今升值400倍（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508781_y_12634100296ae0bb1dd4dd6-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>爺爺當年用10億買入股票，持有至今升值400倍（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508780_y_1803007306ae0bb20edbb1-1024x566.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 江美儀 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"531\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/photo_6269448429121508780_y_1803007306ae0bb20edbb1-1024x566.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_